## Alternative Scenarios & Stress Tests
 With the recent cost of living crisis and inflation rates increasing above the government's target rate for inflation (2%), I also conducted a stress test based on a high inflation rate of 6%. The cashflow shows that should this high level of inflation continue at the assumed rate, there would be no shortfall that requires your pension or investment funds to be used.
