. As the Fund is managed with the aim of maximising returns in line with its long term risk profile any potential returns are likely to be limited by the risk profile of the Fund.
. To achieve its objective the Fund will invest a minimum of 70% in other funds, including funds which aim to track the performance of market indices . The other funds will in turn invest in a range of asset types such as shares of companies ( equities ), bonds and property that make up the index. The Fund will be invested across global markets.
