## (ii) Interest on cash balances
Interest on monies held in Your Cash Account within Your Pension Portfolio is paid gross.
## (iii) VAT
Any charges that are Ours or that We pay to Your Adviser or DIM will include VAT where applicable. Please note this is based on Our understanding of current legislation and is subject to change.
