With the Self-Select phased income drawdown option, your adviser can create a mix of non-taxable and taxable income, tailored to your individual tax planning requirements. This is driven from your tax-free income requirement. You can invest any remaining crystallised funds for when you need them. Self-Select income drawdown is not available to capped drawdown clients - see 'Capped drawdown'.
