## (i) Income Tax and Capital Gains Tax
All income and capital growth produced from the Investments is free of any UK income and capital gains tax. Some Investment returns may be received by the Fund manager with tax credits, or after tax deductions, which cannot be reclaimed. If You sell or dispose of Investments in Your Pension Portfolio this will not constitute a capital gains tax chargeable event under current legislation.
## (ii) Interest on cash balances
Interest on monies held in Your Cash Account within Your Pension Portfolio is paid gross.
