You can change Your mind within 30 days of Us receiving Your first Payment. For regular Payments, this will normally be on the first direct debit Payment date You have given Us. For single Payments, Your cancellation period will start when We receive the Payment; and You have received a confirmation schedule from Us. For transfers, We'll notify You when we have received the transfer money and Your cancellation period will start from that date. You must notify Us by telephone, email or in writing if You wish to cancel.
